# Setup checklist:
# 1. Database caalm-demo exists; critical schema cloned
# 2. Seed permissions + role_permissions into caalm-demo (roles already seeded)
# 3. Deploy separate Vercel env with these vars
# 4. Visit /try → sign up → OTP 123456 → dashboard
